{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NORMAL DELIVERY... OR IS IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max is just an ordinary guy, living from one order to the next as a courier. But one day, his routine shatters. Disturbing posters of a missing girl appear all over the city. His next delivery takes him to a dark, long-abandoned building that would be better left alone. What was once a simple job turns into a deadly trap\u2014one that won\u2019t be easy to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.poster.avif?t=1759414094\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.webm?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/01ce8d2198c0926ea201262d6fbde889.mp4?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>QTE \u2013 ACT FAST AND PRECISELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dynamic gameplay filled with Quick Time Events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive this nightmare, Max needs your help. Pass QTEs successfully to make him dodge, hide, or fight back at the right moment. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/5a6839ab316e2a7067a8885881dbe855.poster.avif?t=1759414094\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/5a6839ab316e2a7067a8885881dbe855.webm?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/5a6839ab316e2a7067a8885881dbe855.mp4?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER NEW PATHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress on a story map and uncover new branches that catch your interest. Each unique fragment you find will bring you closer to piecing together the Foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/f824495eee6de8c02fdd36cb9242531e.poster.avif?t=1759414094\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/f824495eee6de8c02fdd36cb9242531e.webm?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/extras/f824495eee6de8c02fdd36cb9242531e.mp4?t=1759414094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QTEs &amp; Choices</strong> \u2013 A high level of interactivity. You\u2019re not just watching a movie\u2014you\u2019re in control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 The story unfolds non-linearly. You decide Max\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Tree</strong> \u2013 A clear map of your journey helps you see the choices you\u2019ve made and the ones still waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063840?t=1759414094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/6b91ca6b1e9cce3dc6ae7c9b230953a5deba6a4f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759414094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/