r map of your journey helps you see the choices you\u2019ve made and the ones still waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul>","developers":["If Rewind Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063840/556847b05b487caa314cb5f30f0210d12b12f846/header.jpg?t=1759414094","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13+ 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063840/2039629828/3c60f7199ea724ea51ae266073fe40288f524aac/1759087768/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759414091","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063840/2039629828/3c60f7199ea724ea51ae266073fe40288f524aac/1759087768/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759414091","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063840/2039629828/3c60f7199ea724ea51ae266073fe40288f524aac/1759087768/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759414091","id":257206380,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206380/movie480.mp4?t=1759414091","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206380/movie_max.mp4?t=1759414091"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206380/442046586429a8a25839061a585ffbea0eac2b1a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759414091","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206380/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759414091","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206380/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759414091"}}],"name":"Deliver Die Die","package_groups":[],"pc_